word]. (S, O, TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  Also n. un. of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فُوفٌ</span>. (S,
M, O, K.) See this latter word, in three places.

